.Dd @MAN_DATE@
.Dt GLYPHASTORE_VERIFY_STORE 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm glyphastore_verify_store
.Nd verify a GlyphaStore durable data directory
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl hV
.Op Fl Fl json
.Op Fl Fl no-scan
.Ar data-directory
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
performs read-only structural validation of a durable Store data directory
(GlyphaStore
.Sy @PROJECT_VERSION@ ) .
It takes the exclusive Store lock and fails closed if a daemon or Store already
holds it.
.Sy Stop the daemon before verifying.
.Pp
Default work:
.Bl -enum -compact
.It
Exclusive-lock the data directory.
.It
Decode
.Pa manifest.glypha
and enforce Manifest resource bounds.
.It
Audit the namespace (missing/unlisted/unsafe entries fail; crash temporaries may
be reported).
.It
Open each catalog Segment read-only against Manifest identity.
.It
Check Manifest role versus commit lifecycle.
.It
Scan each committed Record extent unless
.Fl Fl no-scan .
.El
.Pp
Does not rebuild Indexes, check key routing, or repair files.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl h , Fl Fl help
Show help and exit 0.
.It Fl V , Fl Fl version
Show version and exit 0.
.It Fl Fl json
Emit a stable JSON report on stdout.
.It Fl Fl no-scan
Validate Manifest, namespace, and Segment headers only.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Bl -tag -width Ds -compact
.It 0
Validated.
.It 1
Validation or I/O failure.
.It 2
Usage error.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr glyphastore 7 ,
.Xr glyphastore_backup_store 1 ,
.Xr glyphastore_repair_store 1 ,
.Xr glyphastored 8
.Sh AUTHORS
GlyphaStore contributors.
